  {
   "id": "e7_form",
   "music": "cosmic",
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "Krishna laughed, and blazed with light. For one moment the court saw gods and worlds within him. Even the blind king saw.",
     "hi": "कृष्ण हँसे, और प्रकाश से जगमगा उठे। एक क्षण के लिए सभा ने उनमें देवता और लोक देखे। अंधे राजा ने भी देखा।"
    },
    {
     "who": "DHRITA",
     "en": "I see... at last, I see.",
